OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 25 Aug to Thu 3 Sep
OL,6,FBecoming more unsettled and changeable
OL,7,Ffrom the south at the start of this
OL,8,Fperiod, as showers or longer spells of
OL,9,Frain spread north across many parts of
OL,10,Fthe UK. Some heavy bursts and
OL,11,Fthunderstorms are likely at times.
OL,12,FThereafter, it will likely remain
OL,13,Fchangeable through the rest of August
OL,14,Fand into early September, with
OL,15,Frainfall amounts probably above
OL,16,Faverage for the time year. Some drier,
OL,17,Fmore settled interludes could develop
OL,18,Fat times. Temperatures are likely to
OL,19,Fbe near average, although some short-
OL,20,Flived warm or hot spells are possible,
OL,21,Fespecially in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
